      "content": "## Chat Entry Files Found\n\nThe project contains several files related to chat entry functionality:\n\n### Main Components\n1. **ChatEntryMobile.vue** - Mobile-specific chat entry display component\n2. **ChatEntry.vue** - Main chat entry component (referenced but not shown in detail)\n3. **ChatMessageList.vue** - Container for rendering multiple chat entries\n4. **Chat.vue** - Main chat interface/container\n\n### Supporting Files\n5. **chats.js** - State management/store for chats\n6. **chatManager.js** - Chat management utility class\n7. **ChatFileList.vue** - File list for chat attachments\n8. **KanbanFilesView.vue** - File view for kanban board with chat references\n\n### Key Functionality Across Files\n- **Message display** - ChatEntry components render individual messages\n- **Message streaming** - Real-time message updates during generation\n- **File attachments** - Managing files associated with chat entries\n- **Editing** - Edit message support with visual feedback\n- **Tasks/Subtasks** - Creating subtasks from chat\n- **Threads** - Message threading support\n- **Mobile support** - Dedicated mobile component variant\n\nWould you like me to examine any specific file in detail or help with modifications?",
